  "details": "Hello! I’ve had this issue forever, but lately I’ve been more active in VRC and it’s becoming increasingly problematic.\n\nLike clockwork, after 20-30 minutes in a world, all voice chat will start breaking up and then go completely silent. The only solution I’ve found to fix it is to rejoin the instance.\n\nI’ve tried it with two different wired VR headsets and even reformatted my PC, leading me to believe it’s an issue with my computer or network.\n\nPC Specs:\n\n- EVGA GeForce GTX 1070\n\n- Intel i7-7700K @ 4.2GHz\n\n- 16 GB G.SKILL Ripjaws V DDR4 3600\n\n- ASUS ROG STRIX Z270i\n\n- 512 GB m.2 SSD\n\nThank you for your time",
